[{"id":"VRCE-6-63-1","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":63,"verse":1,"english":"On that furious and destructive carnage proceeding, Angada eager for encounter, approached the heroic Kampana.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.78,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-76-1"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6063001","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"d32c67d608e934af4163f3e7e3ecb831f6f62036bedb57b0f5e16ca462c56adf","compact":"40ee7794d4f8f7ece756d9f8deb8da494668b7207d3af519a18c984dc830f334","nasal":"a5edf1b246b47ae0f14c2408c9727c1987dd9447e7d7326ed870d4533c0608b0"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-63-2","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":63,"verse":2,"english":"Thereat, challenging Angada in wrath, he assailed him with impetuosity. And Kampana dealt a blow to Angada with his mace; and thereat, wounded with it, he reeled.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.846,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-76-2"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6063002","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"4202281c0e99999875248e121c477449a857723a1989ad2a32274d27dc9a1bfd","compact":"6d81f24ec047ee5fdcbe9b7601d5b6ff647176c2675db784cd319c02d6d4c358","nasal":"3c6f00225cd4e45efc8ce2a7672a730ac17029ae8515dc52d19205438ff988e3"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-63-3","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":63,"verse":3,"english":"Then regaining his senses, that energetic one hurled a mountain-top. Borne down by the blow, Kampana dropped down to the earth.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-76-3"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6063003","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"dd8418051740c24654f69264d6110dd7865851060cd5bf519ac7013501f6ddde","compact":"e3d9a3c9d3056f4edd50d6883b06ac85f5cdecb